{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And you shall sanctify yourselves, for I am YHWH your Elohim.</b> [This connects to] \"You shall be holy\" — I gave you a statute to keep them, in order to sanctify you. Scripture has already mentioned this. The reason [it appears here] is to include the resident aliens who dwell among Israel, for they are obligated to be holy, because they dwell in a holy land."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:18.352751557Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}